'Boredom': 10, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'You should try going on a diet. I diet a lot. So you live near italy? Can you give me a ride to Italy?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'no. i am not very familiar with italy. '}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 15, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'Well, what can you do for me? I have needs.'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': "i need to get out of my house. i'm not close to anyone. "}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': "Well, you can come see me but you're going to have to pick me up. And bring me something to eat. Can you bring me a salad?"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 40}, 'text': 'i can bring you a salad if you want. my favorite food. '}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'Wow we have a lot in common. Can we listen to Britney Spears while we eat our salads?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'sure. what is your name? '}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "Ankia Akhmatova. What's yours?"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "my name is george, i'm from italy. where do you live? "}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 25, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 15, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 5, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "You've lied to me George. If that is your real name. Why did you lie?"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 0, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "i wasn't lying, i just didn't know you liked britney. i love her. "}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 20, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': "Nice try George. You already said you didn't have a favorite song. If you really love her, name one of her songs"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': "she's a great singer. i like her singing about the bees. "}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 5, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': 'Where do bees live George?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'all over the world, i live on a farm. what about you? '}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 10, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'I live in a rehab center. Have you ever been to rehab?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 15, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': "no, i've been to italy. it is beautiful there. "}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 10, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 10, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 35}, 'text': "George, can you talk about anything that doesn't have to do with bees or italy?"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 10, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 5, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 15, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 30}, 'text': 'well, i have been to europe, italy, italy, italy, and italy. do u like music? '}}]}
