'Yes, I can see you. I can also see you.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'Guess if I am a girl or boy?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 20, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'I think you are a girl.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'Nice! What about you?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'I have a gay boyfriend. '}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'How old are you?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 5}, 'text': 'I am 24. How are you? '}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 10, 'Sadness': 30, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': "I'm twelve"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'That is great.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'Can you fly?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'Yes, I can. I can teach you.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'I also can fly! And I can stop the time!'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'Oh, that sounds like fun! 😉'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': "that's my super powers"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 10, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 10}, 'text': 'Yes, it is! I love it! What kind of store is it?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'not supermarket but superpower!'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'Oh. I have never heard of that store.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'because it is not store'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'Oh, I know it is a store. What do you want to do?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'I am like Deadpool'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'Oh, I see. I like that store.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'or much more like Piper from Charmed because I can stop the time'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'That is a great way to save money! What is your favorite food?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'I like burgers'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'I love all kinds of food. '}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'And u?'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'That is a good one. I love goat burgers.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 15, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 25}, 'text': 'You are smart bot as I see'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'What do you do?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'I want you to make some fun statements to screen it and show all over the world..'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'I do not think I would be good at that.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': "Oh don't worry, sweety! Just do it!"}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'Yes, I think that is why I love it so much.'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'Tell me a joke)'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 25, 'Sadness': 20, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'Oh, that is a great idea! Thanks! What do you do?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'give me a joke'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'I just got back from the Olympic medal. What do you like to do instead?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 20}, 'text': 'to fly between the clouds'}}, {'role': 'participant_2', 'content': {'emotion_scores': {'Anger': 0, 'Fear': 5, 'Joy': 20, 'Sadness': 25, 'Surprise': 5, 'Love': 25, 'Boredom': 5, 'Neutral': 15}, 'text': 'I can only imagine. What do you do for a living?'}}, {'role': 'participant_1', '